		{
			description: ["In a world ruled by the strong, your fists speak louder than words. The Skill Changer Book holds the key to mastering a vast array of fighting techniques — from swift strikes to earth-shaking blows. Every warrior sails with their own style… now it's your turn to discover yours. The sea is calling — will you rise to its challenge?"]
