		{
			dependencies: ["1CF1CCA62A3359D2"]
			description: [
				"&lIMPORTANT: Only eat the fruit after using the Skill Changer book in your inventory."
				""
				"Across the vast seas lie ancient treasure chests, hidden in ruins, buried deep underground, or lost in the wreckage of forgotten ships. These chests hold the key to unimaginable power — a Devil Fruit. There are 22 different fruits, each granting a unique ability, and you never know which one you'll get. Open this quest to receive one random fruit, just as if you had cracked open a treasure chest in the wild. Keep your eyes sharp — these chests are the only way to find more!"
			]
