		{
			dependencies: ["1CF1CCA62A3359D2"]
			description: ["The world of One Piece: The Ultimate Experience is made up of vast oceans and scattered islands — a true sailor’s paradise. To survive and explore, you’ll need a ship. Craft your first vessel using any blocks you like, large or small, then place a Ship Helm to control it. To raise your sails and set off on your journey, press the \"]\" key. The sea is your new home — sail wisely, captain."]
			icon: "smallships:oak_cog"
