		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1CF1CCA62A3359D2"]
			description: ["Before you conquer the seas, you must master the basics. Mine Piece introduces powerful abilities and a pirate crew system. Press R to switch between your combat skills, and Z to unleash them in battle. Feeling ambitious? Press V to create your very own pirate faction and carve your name into the ocean's legacy. Learn the controls, then claim the Grand Line as your own!"]
			icon: "aquamirae:dead_sea_scroll"
