		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1CF1CCA62A3359D2"]
			description: ["As you sail further and grow in infamy, the world won’t stay quiet. Enemies become fiercer, bosses deadlier, and the seas more unforgiving. To survive, open your skill tree with K and unlock powerful new techniques. Choose your path wisely—every decision shapes your destiny as a pirate in a world that never stops getting harder."]
